    "detailed_description": "One day, cracks appeared in the sky. A mysterious energy came out of these cracks. Because of this energy, some people awakened strange abilities. Later, it was discovered that these cracks were portals leading to other worlds. In these worlds, there were infinite treasures, but they were also full of traps and deadly enemies. So, they began to call these worlds dungeons. Arinn is a girl with a large debt and, to pay it off, she and her friend Bolt entered a dungeon.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515470/extras/62da96abe9833561e797e6593ceadde4.poster.avif?t=1743704396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515470/extras/62da96abe9833561e797e6593ceadde4.webm?t=1743704396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515470/extras/62da96abe9833561e797e6593ceadde4.mp4?t=1743704396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Arinn is a game with several fun mechanics, such as dash, wall running and flying with the help of her robot friend, Bolt (some adjustments are being made).<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515470/extras/54f52670baacc84561349f048c5d91e7.poster.avif?t=1743704396\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515470/extras/54f52670baacc84561349f048c5d91e7.webm?t=1743704396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2515470/extras/54f52670baacc84561349f048c5d91e7.mp4?t=1743704396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dynamic level design, where you can choose which ability to use to overcome challenges. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>100 challenging and exciting levels. (The demo does not represent the size of the levels that will be available in the final version, which will have over 300 challenge screens.) </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Dozens of traps and deadly enemies.</li></ul> <ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>4 distinct worlds. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Precise and intuitive controls. </li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>3 levels of difficulty.</li></ul><br>Collect all the treasures and help Arinn pay off his debts.",
